bound-lock/1 about="Public API, rendered contracts, compact data and native captures, including the existing files the README links. Validation worlds and their modular dependencies are separate digest-addressed assets; no private executor is shipped in the library." at=witness:044/public-case-layout by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=audit/wire/ships value=dist|README.md|LICENSE|TARGET.bound|receipts.bound|docs/measures.md|samples/measures|vectors/measures|samples/yes/algebra-is-closed.json|samples/yes/field-uses-price-and-debit.json|samples/yes/three-theories-one-algebra.json|src/lattice/index.ts|src/field/motion.ts|samples/yes/installed-artifact.json|samples/no/installed-artifact.json|vectors/measures/installed-artifact.cli.json|docs/img|docs/paper.md|docs/reference.md|docs/learn/in-phase.md|docs/learn/price.md|docs/learn/signature.md|docs/learn/thermometer.md|docs/learn/withdrawal.md|vectors/laws/policy.json|vectors/laws/l7-tolerant-k.json|vectors/laws/l8-phase-defect.json|vectors/laws/l9-mix-loss.json|vectors/laws/implementation-043.json|samples/laws/cofailure-pairs/no/sample.json|samples/laws/cofailure-pairs/yes/sample.json|samples/laws/linage-rest/no/sample.json|samples/laws/linage-rest/yes/sample.json|samples/laws/lineage-ceiling/no/sample.json|samples/laws/lineage-ceiling/yes/sample.json|samples/laws/marginal-information/no/sample.json|samples/laws/marginal-information/yes/sample.json|samples/laws/semilattice/no/sample.json|samples/laws/semilattice/yes/sample.json|vectors/laws/cofailure-pairs.json|vectors/laws/cofailure-pairs.native.json|vectors/laws/coordination.json|vectors/laws/f1/finite-arithmetic.json|vectors/laws/f1/path-witness.json|vectors/laws/helly-comb.json|vectors/laws/helly-comb.lean.json|vectors/laws/linage-rest.native.json|vectors/laws/lineage-ceiling.json|vectors/laws/lineage-ceiling.native.json|vectors/laws/marginal-information.json|vectors/laws/marginal-information.native.json|vectors/laws/meet-semilattice.json|vectors/law