bound-lock/1 about="budget, rank, phase (bands over epochs), distribution (a product of intervals by bucket), stretch (resolutions 1..8) are parametrisations; anything needing a new lattice is a card for lane C" at=witness:forms-written-that-the-wire-refused by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=audit/wire/forms value=interval|alphabet|ladder|formula|budget|rank|phase|stretch|distribution
bound-lock/1 about="receipts.bound in a place is a region rendered at a resolution: @0 the root digest line, @1 one line per region (region, count, digest of its set), @8 every receipt; @1 ships, @8 stays in the root's CAS and travels as a release asset. A region's digest is over its canonical lines, sorted, attest lines excluded; the root digest is the digest of the region digests in region order. Verify's attest names the root digest in its at and stands in the root lock and the release, never inside the set it attests. cost/ship stays 0..1000, never widened; it is met when @1 lands" at=witness:a-set-that-attested-itself by=target form=alphabet measure=resolution role=reads scope=audit/wire/receipts value=0|1|8
bound-lock/1 about="the digest every value of the lock is taken with, and the era it belongs to" at=witness:an-era-named-by-a-digest-nobody-could-read by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=audit/wire/digest-algorithms value=sha256:era1
bound-lock/1 about="the era lines are signed in: every line carries its era in its signature; an era that closes signs nothing new, and what stands under it is signed again by a quorum of the keys it admitted" at=witness:an-era-named-by-a-digest-nobody-could-read by=target form=alphabet measure=id role=reads scope=audit/wire/era value=era1
